  "behavior": [
    "Parameterized::visit_retained_values borrows parameters and nonparameter numerical helpers with explicit completeness; default implementations preserve known parameter values but return incomplete coverage.",
    "Derived modules distinguish descriptive metadata, raw tensor helpers and optional tensor helpers from undeclared skipped fields. Containers and runtime composition visit all known children without short-circuiting on incomplete coverage.",
    "Built-in architecture static owners provide 19 explicit static traversal implementations across shared decoder/composite/family realization surfaces. Parameter identities, mutable visitors and checkpoint roles remain unchanged.",
    "The architecture audit classified 166 skipped fields: 163 metadata fields, two recursively traversed DeepSeek V4 rotary owners and the optional Muse-Glimmer query scale. Nonzero neutral tests check V4 local/compressor/indexer frequency values and both Muse weight conventions.",
    "Resident, bounded, routed and partitioned inventory uses the shared retained-value hook. Loaned units keep the result incomplete while unaffected static and other resident values remain visible.",
    "Native traversal includes linear/embedding/normalization parameters and companions, hyper and grouped mechanisms, scaled rotary denominators and explicit inverse frequencies. Opaque native quantized representation remains incomplete.",
    "Cold physical inventory retains unknown roots without evaluation or completion polling. The former blanket nonstate Unknown marker is removed because explicit module/static completeness now propagates individual missing coverage.",
    "Real scaled Llama execution on Metal verifies nonzero prefill and cached decode, unchanged editable topology, frontier and source-read counts, and actual helper allocation identity/capacity after explicit helper certification outside inventory.",
    "Host-layerwise and disk-streamed scaled Llama tests verify completed idle module inventory returns to the retained static allocation set after temporary unit helpers leave that owner."
  ],
  "corrected_findings": [
    "Two leaf tests assumed deterministic iteration order from a native parameter map. They now compare sorted stable identities; production traversal was not changed.",
    "Completing downstream logits does not necessarily detach a retained dependency descriptor event. Cold allocation_info can remain unknown or become certified during execution. The integration test preserves each captured inventory result, validates the retained helper independently outside inventory and checks a fresh certified inventory against exact physical backing.",
    "An allocation-capacity comparison converts native usize capacity to u64 explicitly before comparing the inventory map."
  ],
